while batteries and critical minerals see a more gradual increase to 25% by 2026.", "url": "https://energy-solutions.co/policy-intelligence/trade-and-tariffs/us-section-301-tariffs-ev-batteries.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "100%", "effective_date": "2024"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_2d0a7c7d756afe9ba9c1cccd", "quote": "Because the US grid urgently needs massive battery storage, the USTR delayed the 25% tariff on 'non-EV' lithium-ion batteries until 2026.", "url": "https://energy-solutions.co/policy-intelligence/trade-and-tariffs/us-section-301-tariffs-ev-batteries.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "USTR", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2026", "reported_policy_status": "delayed"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_3a40b6b756fc2d3bb9e577b5", "claim_ids": ["claim_b26237c5b5ec76b18eee5621", "claim_c96b05bf76be4a7ca94c76f2"], "query_ids": ["q_377"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_b26237c5b5ec76b18eee5621", "quote": "The additional Section 301 rate is 25% for covered Chinese lithium-ion non-EV batteries in 2026.", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "announcement_date": "2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_c96b05bf76be4a7ca94c76f2", "quote": "Following the 2024 four-year review of the China Section 301 actions, the United States scheduled the additional tariff on lithium-ion non-electrical-vehicle batteries from China to increase from 7.5% to 25% in 2026.", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "affected_product": "lithium-ion non-electrical-vehicle batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2026"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_1c9c6f742ef46a0e3db55b92", "claim_ids": ["claim_0a93674ea8508463a1697763", "claim_330b19079d0a3952898c9764"], "query_ids": ["q_377"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0a93674ea8508463a1697763", "quote": "USTR said it would provide details on how companies could apply for machinery exclusions from the tariffs in a separate notice. But it said any exclusions granted would be backdated to start on Wednesday and end on May 31, 2025.", "url": "https://www.reuters.com/markets/us/us-announces-details-higher-china-tariffs-some-start-aug-1-2024-05-22", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "machinery exclusions", "expiration_date": "May 31, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_330b19079d0a3952898c9764", "quote": "Tai has also recommended tariff exclusions for hundreds of industrial machinery import categories from China, including solar product manufacturing equipment.", "url": "https://www.reuters.com/markets/us/us-announces-details-higher-china-tariffs-some-start-aug-1-2024-05-22", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "tariff exclusions", "affected_product": "industrial machinery import categories from China, including solar product manufacturing equipment"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_e273fc4a6a79c530b6b3957c", "claim_ids": ["claim_b26237c5b5ec76b18eee5621", "claim_dc31dff61087eda7747d0aa0"], "query_ids": ["q_377"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_b26237c5b5ec76b18eee5621", "quote": "The additional Section 301 rate is 25% for covered Chinese lithium-ion non-EV batteries in 2026.", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "announcement_date": "2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_dc31dff61087eda7747d0aa0", "quote": "Lithium-ion batteries classified under 85